  "pages": [
    {
      "slug": "intro",
      "sourceFile": "01-intro.md",
      "title": "Conformance Fixture",
      "order": 1,
      "meta": {
        "title": "Conformance Fixture",
        "section": "intro"
      },
      "sections": [
        "intro"
      ],
      "markdown": "\n# Conformance fixture\n\nA fictional brand book. It is not a brand: it is the input of `test/core/tokens/conformance.test.ts` for the parts of\nRFC 0001 that the starter does not reach. Every approver, source and license in it is invented.\n",
      "directives": []
    },
    {
      "slug": "logo",
      "sourceFile": "02-logo.md",
      "title": "Logo",
      "order": 2,
      "meta": {
        "title": "Logo",
        "section": "logo"
      },
      "sections": [
        "logo"
      ],
      "markdown": "\nThe fictional logo with the mark of a fictional program.\n\n<!-- blazon:logo-initiative logos/example-ink -->\n",
      "directives": [
        {
          "name": "logo-initiative",
          "args": [
            "logos/example-ink"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "color",
      "sourceFile": "03-color.md",
      "title": "Color",
      "order": 3,
      "meta": {
        "title": "Color",
        "section": "color"
      },
      "sections": [
        "color"
      ],
      "markdown": "\nThree fictional colors, each approved by an invented approver.\n",
      "directives": []
    },
    {
      "slug": "type",
      "sourceFile": "04-type.md",
      "title": "Typography",
      "order": 4,
      "meta": {
        "title": "Typography",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      "sections": [
        "typography"
      ],
      "markdown": "\nTwo fictional typefaces with their source and license.\n",
      "directives": []
    },
    {
      "slug": "explorations",
      "sourceFile": "05-explorations.md",
      "title": "Explorations",
      "order": 5,
      "meta": {
        "title": "Explorations"
      },
      "sections": [],
      "markdown": "\nDirections that were tried and are not the identity. The category is marked `experimental`, so its `needs-review` sidecar raises no warning here.\n\n<!-- blazon:assets experiments -->\n",
      "directives": [
        {
          "name": "assets",
          "args": [
            "experiments"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
